              <div class="split-copy reveal reveal-d1">
                <span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
                <h2 class="display-h2">Born from a love of sharing China with the world</h2>
                <p>            Jing · Meet China began in 2012 in a small Shanghai office, with one guide, one driver,
                  and a simple conviction: that the China we love — its mountain villages, night markets,
                  courtyard homes, and generous people — is best discovered in your own way, at your own pace.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Founder <strong>Zhang Wei</strong> spent five years guiding backpackers across the country before
                  realizing that international travelers didn't need bigger buses and stricter schedules.
                  They needed <strong>someone who would listen</strong> — then carefully build a journey around
                  what they heard.
                </p>
                <p>            Today our team of 20+ travel designers and licensed guides serves guests from more than
                  40 countries, from first-time visitors to seasoned explorers, from honeymooners to
                  three-generation family reunions. We remain a fully licensed Chinese travel agency
                  (License No. L-SH-CJ00088), and we still believe what we believed on day one:
                  <strong>a great journey is a conversation, not a schedule.</strong>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
